@startuml 004-results-view-sequence
title 004 results-view：時序圖

actor "第3組" as S3
actor "老師" as T
actor "第1組" as S1
participant "app.py" as App
participant "views" as V
participant "results" as R
participant "ScoringRule" as Rule

S3 -> App : POST /api/student/submit {question: 2}
App -> V : teacher_view
V -> R : build、team_scores
R -> Rule : rank(第 2 題送出紀錄)
Rule --> R : 排名、得主、分數
App --> T : 推播 board（第 2 題第3組：答案、第 1 順位、搶答成功）
App -> V : student_view(第1組)
note right of V : 搶答中不含 results，內容不變則不推送

T -> App : POST /api/teacher/end
App -> V : student_view(第1組)（phase = ended）
V -> R : build、team_scores
App --> S1 : 推播 results＋team_scores
App --> T : 推播 board（與學生 results 相同）
@enduml
